    "id": "airgap-flow",
    "caption": "Air-gapped delivery: everything is bundled and checksummed on the connected side, carried across, verified, mirrored into the internal registry, and installed with nothing reaching out.",
    "alt": "On the connected side, a build machine renders the chart to list images, exports images and charts with skopeo and helm pull, adds model weights, and writes checksums into one bundle. The bundle crosses the air gap through the customer's approved transfer process. Inside, operators verify checksums, push images and charts into the internal registry, and install into the cluster, whose runtime mirror configuration points only at the internal registry.",
